# Copyrighted third-party material (#846). Papers, handbooks, scans, figure
# crops and supplementary files live in sources/, which is ignored whatever
# the file type; sources/.gitignore is the second lock. docs/ is an
# ALLOWLIST: everything is ignored except directories and our own .md, so a
# new file type or folder stays out until someone allows it here. Digitised
# coordinates are measurements and go to validation/. The pre-commit hook
# scripts/check_no_sources.py (and CI) catch a forced add.
/sources/*
!/sources/.gitignore
/docs/**
!/docs/**/
!/docs/**/*.md

# Benchmark run outputs (auto-generated, not for tracking)
benchmarks/runs/
benchmarks/network_solver_benchmark_latest.json
gui/nw_*.json
gui/tmp/

